276
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:12,900
What's this?

277
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,198
They're retreating?

278
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:18,240
I don't understand what's going on.

279
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:21,800
Master Boxxo!

280
00:16:23,340 --> 00:16:25,120
Hold on, Boxxo!

281
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:26,860
Are you okay?

282
00:16:38,940 --> 00:16:40,760
Voxo, is this your doing?

283
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:43,140
And who is this man? The prisoner?

284
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:54,540
He uses a ring to channel
the Netherlord's power.

285
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:56,420
I can't even...

286
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:02,680
Points decreased by 600.

287
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:04,177
Wait, what's happening?

288
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:06,620
Points decreased by 404.

289
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:09,040
Put down the barrier! Boss, no!

290
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:11,986
If you don't drop it
right now, I'll break it!

291
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,660
I'll smash it to pieces!

292
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:15,552
What's wrong with Lamas?

293
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,856
She's not acting like her usual self.

294
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:23,480
Matthew eats.

295
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:25,020
He has to pay.

296
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:27,457
If it's the last thing I do, he'll pay!

297
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:29,060
Stop this! It's him!

298
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,100
That man!

299
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:33,337
He's the one who used monsters
to destroy my village!

300
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:35,640
He has to die for what he's done!

301
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,100
Let go!

302
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:40,020
So that's what's going on.

303
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:42,500
Please, Lamas. Calm down.

304
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,637
You must get your anger under control.

305
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:46,257
I understand what you're feeling.

306
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:49,077
After all the years of anger
and hatred for this man,

307
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,757
and he's finally in front of you?

308
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:54,134
but you mustn't let your
emotions get the better of you.

309
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,977
This man may have
information that we need.

310
00:17:57,060 --> 00:17:59,217
There are countless people
in other strata who are

311
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,535
suffering and struggling hard
to survive this calamity.

312
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:05,177
Don't let them experience
the same tragedy.

313
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:10,040
If you can set aside your desire
for revenge, we can save them.

314
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:14,040
I hear you.

315
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:15,940
And you're right.

316
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,700
Sorry, Director Bear.

317
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,100
I'll go repair the wall.

318
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:22,860
I need some time alone.

319
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,470
Lamis.

320
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:33,337
Now then you're going to answer all my
questions and tell us what you know.

321
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:37,417
If you hold anything back I can
promise you won't have an easy death.

322
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:41,857
If you cooperate and give us a full
confession I'll allow you to die painlessly.

323
00:18:41,940 --> 00:18:45,257
There's no hint of the kind and
gentle director bear that I know.

324
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:49,800
He's a wild beast who will make
your soul wilt with just a look.

325
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:54,317
Boxer, could you stay with
Llamas for a little bit?

326
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:56,917
Don't worry, you can leave
the dirty work to us.

327
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:59,941
This is something that's
best left to an old hand.

328
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:01,050
Hello, there!

329
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:20,077
I don't know what I should
even say to her right now.

330
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,360
I can finally talk in a limited way.

331
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,785
And yet I can't think of
anything worth saying.

332
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,480
Boxxo, forgive me.

333
00:19:29,740 --> 00:19:33,520
All this time, I've wanted to
get revenge from mom and dad,

334
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:36,309
along with everybody
else from the village.

335
00:19:37,580 --> 00:19:40,237
That's the reason I became
a hunter in the first place,

336
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:42,614
and tried to get as strong as possible.

337
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:53,880
That's why, when I saw him there,
my mind went completely blank.

338
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:56,120
I lost control.

339
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:12,520
No matter what happens, I
know my place is by her side.

340
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:15,781
I'll do my best to make
up for anything she lacks.

341
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:20,020
If her heart is darkened by
sadness, I'll repaint it with joy.

342
00:20:21,140 --> 00:20:22,500
I'll be there for her.

343
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,085
That's my duty as her partner.

344
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:28,120
With you two, an end.

345
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:34,317
I hope she understood
what I was trying to say.

346
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:36,077
I'm not going to let myself die,

347
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:40,513
so I'll be with you until you quit
being a hunter, or something like that.

348
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:45,217
Um, Boxxo?

349
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:47,797
What you just said, did I hear you right?

350
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:49,920
You want us to get married?

351
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:53,757
Wait, you definitely
heard me wrong, Lamas.

352
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:55,277
I'm not against the idea,

353
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:57,877
but my mother got married to
my father when she was 18,

354
00:20:57,960 --> 00:21:01,637
so ideally I'd like to get hitched
at the same age if possible.

355
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,020
Um, are you listening?

356
00:21:03,280 --> 00:21:06,337
I'm really happy that you proposed, but I
think that it might be a little too soon.

357
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:08,257
We should get to know
each other better first.

358
00:21:08,340 --> 00:21:09,997
And what can we do about children?

359
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:12,657
Maybe I could get Hulemy to
make some little boxos for us.

360
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:13,570
Wouldn't that be cute?

361
00:21:13,653 --> 00:21:15,977
This misunderstanding just
keeps getting worse and worse.

362
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:16,890
Oh, I know.

363
00:21:16,973 --> 00:21:18,657
We should make our way
to the end of the dungeon

364
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:20,877
so we can turn you back
into a human being.

365
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:25,477
I love you the way you are, Boxo, but I'd
really like to see you as a human, too.

366
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:28,717
And we could do things like hold
hands and go on dates together?

367
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:31,637
It looks like I threw her for too
much of a loop when she was down,

368
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,073
and now she's confused.

369
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:37,915
Besides, is romance between a vending
machine and a human even possible?

370
00:21:38,120 --> 00:21:39,140
What am I saying?

371
00:21:39,340 --> 00:21:40,620
I need to calm down!

372
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:42,150
Just kidding.

373
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:45,697
I know that you were only trying to
cheer me up because I was feeling upset.

374
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:46,617
And it worked!

375
00:21:46,700 --> 00:21:47,876
I feel a lot better!

376
00:21:48,020 --> 00:21:49,457
Thanks so much, Boxo!

377
00:21:49,540 --> 00:21:51,620
So Lamas was just messing with me?

378
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:54,213
I was this close to taking it seriously.

379
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:57,342
Anyway, it's finally time
to get this wall fixed.

380
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,997
For a second there, I wasn't
sure how things would go.

381
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:03,500
But it worked out, and Lamas
is in a much better mood now.

382
00:22:19,540 --> 00:22:20,370
Wow!

383
00:22:24,380 --> 00:22:25,437
Take my plane.

384
00:22:25,520 --> 00:22:27,380
This one is changing andzen.

385
00:22:29,580 --> 00:22:32,640
It's never got no altitude anymore.

386
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:36,842
I'll keep using my passe-luge
Знаing your dzieck.

387
00:22:39,300 --> 00:22:43,640
And right now, move on
myCal improving day.

388
00:22:44,300 --> 00:22:47,740
What time do I take?

389
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,700
You could even win a reward!

390
00:23:37,780 --> 00:23:39,898
I look forward to serving you again!
